    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "6C45357949483B90",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要挑戰與蟲相伴甜點師……\\n道館館主阿楓嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "6C453879494840A9",
      "text": "那麼，請讓我帶[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳前往對戰場。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "6C45377949483EF6",
      "text": "等[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳準備好後，\\n請隨時告訴我一聲。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_entry_01",
      "hash64": "646E2CD7DF034FC2",
      "text": "親愛的彩粉蝶，\\n要多～吃一點喔～[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_poke_entry_01",
      "hash64": "65F00449FA87129F",
      "text": "粉菜～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_01",
      "hash64": "873EDBF65FF9575F",
      "text": "哎呀哎呀～\\n好出色的訓練家～[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_02",
      "hash64": "873EDCF65FF95912",
      "text": "謝謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳把橄欖滾得\\n咕嚕咕嚕順溜溜的唷～[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_03",
      "hash64": "873EDDF65FF95AC5",
      "text": "哎呀～\\n我還沒自我介紹是吧～？[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_04",
      "hash64": "873ED6F65FF94EE0",
      "text": "我是派舒蕾・慕滋的店長，\\n阿楓～[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_05",
      "hash64": "873ED7F65FF95093",
      "text": "哎呀呀～？\\n我現在是在圓模道館上班呢～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_06",
      "hash64": "873ED8F65FF95246",
      "text": "錯了錯了～\\n我是道館館主，阿楓～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_07",
      "hash64": "873ED9F65FF953F9",
      "text": "平常我是做點心的\\n甜點師唷～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_08",
      "hash64": "873EE2F65FF96344",
      "text": "不論是吃一口就能帶來幸福的點心，\\n或是藏身在草木之間的蟲寶可夢，\\r\\n這些小小的存在，都有大大的力量呢～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_09",
      "hash64": "873EE3F65FF964F7",
      "text": "請站穩腳步，\\n以免栽個大筋斗唷～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_10",
      "hash64": "874260F65FFC6F35",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的實力即使是在對戰時\\n也不斷地在膨脹呢～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_11",
      "hash64": "87425FF65FFC6D82",
      "text": "看來我也要更～加地\\n進化才行～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_12",
      "hash64": "87425EF65FFC6BCF",
      "text": "言歸正傳，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳及格囉～！\\n作為戰勝道館館主的證明，\\r\\n這道館徽章就給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳囉～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_16",
      "hash64": "87425AF65FFC6503",
      "text": "還有阿楓我特製的手工蛋糕，\\n也請一起好～好享用～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_badge",
      "hash64": "03E0CD0DB4E5B087",
      "text": "如果[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳擁有[VAR 0x0200(0001)]個道館徽章的話，\\n就會比較容易捕捉等級[VAR 0x0201(0002)]以下的寶可夢，\\r\\n而且牠們都會聽[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的話唷～[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
